<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.15 vs   0.20</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.44 vs   0.56</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.22 vs   1.08</p>
<p> Sales		   29.64 vs  21.47</p>
